#: pybamm.models.submodels.current_collector.potential_pair.BasePotentialPair:1
msgid ""
"A submodel for Ohm's law plus conservation of current in the current "
"collectors. For details on the potential pair formulation see :footcite:t:"
"`Timms2021` and :footcite:t:`Marquis2020`."
msgstr ""

